---
// experience-about-skills.md — Experience. Copy verbatim from the locked set.
---

<section id="path" class="section path" data-quiet aria-labelledby="path-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="path-heading" class="label" data-reveal="label">
      <span>Work experience</span><span class="label-rule"></span>
    </h2>

    <div class="path-entry" data-reveal>
      <div class="path-meta">
        <p class="t-mono-s path-when">Jun 2025 — Aug 2025</p>
        <p class="t-mono-s path-where">Cairo, Egypt</p>
      </div>
      <div class="path-body">
        <h3 class="t-h2 path-role" data-reveal="lines">
          Full-Stack Developer Intern<span class="path-org">Caresynq Business Consulting</span>
        </h3>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            At Caresynq I worked on healthcare web applications used by clinic staff and partner
            teams. I built React UI features, developed and maintained REST APIs in Node.js and
            Express for authentication, patient records, and clinic operations, and wrote MongoDB
            queries while testing and debugging the backend. I also helped migrate legacy ASP.NET
            components to a React and Node.js stack and supported testing during the rollout. The
            team ran on Git pull requests, code reviews, daily stand-ups, and sprint planning,
            which is where I learned to ship inside someone else's process.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .path-entry {
    max-width: 64rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-5);
    padding-top: var(--space-5);
    border-top: var(--hairline) solid var(--line-2);
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .path-entry {
      grid-template-columns: 13rem minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-6);
    }
  }
  .path-when {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .path-where {
    color: var(--ink-3);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: var(--space-1);
  }
  .path-role {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }
  .path-org {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-mono);
    letter-spacing: var(--track-mono);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--acc);
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }
</style>
